 "poem": "The current world with wonder\nBasks in the reflected light.\nWe have its hues and colors, so\nTo see each thing unite,\nLike a new creation of spirit\nDissolving in illusion. Again,\nAt last the curtain falls behind us,\nAnd we are free to wander somewhere.\nI am a newcomer there;\nNewcomer from afar,\nNow I seek alone for some surprise,\nA chance unknown before.",
